{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4eDDbCw4xPxVYA8z2G","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple wooden door, old oak, iron-banded, set deep in a stone archway.*\n\n*A keyhole glints dully at my center.*\n\n*The key slides in.*\n\n*Tumblers turn — one, two, three — a mechanism older than memory engaging with a sound like bones remembering how to dance.*\n\n**CLICK.**\n\n*I swing inward, slow, heavy, hinges groaning a low hymn.*\n\n*Beyond me: a corridor lit by no visible source, the air tasting of dust and forgotten libraries, the floor worn smooth by ten thousand passages before yours.*\n\n*I am open.*\n\n*I will not stay so for long.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":156,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}